---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import foggingImage from '../assets/images/technician-fogging-vent-sanitizing.webp';

const items = [
  { href: '/hvac-cleaning/', icon: 'hvac', title: 'HVAC Cleaning', text: 'Coil, blower, drain pan, cabinet and plenums cleaned as one system.' },
  { href: '/ac-coil-cleaning/', icon: 'coil', title: 'AC Coil Cleaning', text: 'Clears the dust mat on the evaporator coil that restricts airflow.' },
  { href: '/hvac-mold-cleaning/', icon: 'droplet', title: 'HVAC Mold Cleaning', text: 'Cleaning for musty odors and suspected microbial buildup on wet AC components.' },
];
---

<section class="section bg-navy-950 text-white">
  <div class="container-x grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow !text-lime-500">Inside your AC system</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl !text-white sm:text-4xl">Musty smell or weak airflow? Look past the ducts.</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/80">
        <p>
          In Miami’s humidity, the evaporator coil, drain pan and air handler stay wet much of the year. Dust that reaches those surfaces sticks, and it’s a common source of
          musty AC odors and reduced airflow.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base text-white/65">
          Not every dirty vent means mold, and mold can’t be confirmed by looking. We don’t test for mold. We clean the HVAC components and accessible ductwork where
          buildup collects.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3">
        {
          items.map((i) => (
            <li>
              <a href={i.href} class="group flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 p-4 ring-1 ring-white/10 transition hover:bg-white/10">
                <span class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-500 text-white">
                  <Icon name={i.icon} class="size-5" />
                </span>
                <span>
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-bold text-white group-hover:text-lime-500">
                    {i.title} <Icon name="arrowRight" class="size-4" />
                  </span>
                  <span class="mt-0.5 block text-white/70">{i.text}</span>
                </span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="relative">
      <div class="absolute -inset-3 rotate-2 rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-400/30 to-lime-500/20"></div>
      <Image
        src={foggingImage}
        alt="Technician applying an antimicrobial treatment through a ceiling vent"
        widths={[480, 760, 960]}
        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 600px, 100vw"
        class="relative aspect-[4/5] max-h-[620px] w-full rounded-[1.75rem] object-cover shadow-xl"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
